## Phase 4 — Path Forcing (Round 4 + Round 5)

**Goal:** 최단 경로 corridor 셀을 모두 칠해야 승리.

### P4.1 Required cells (`gameLogic.ts`)
- `generateLevel(..., { requireTrailCoverage })` → `requiredCells: TPosition[]`
- BFS parent map으로 shortest-path corridor 계산
- Win: `atGoal && requiredCells.every(p => trail[p.row][p.col])`

### P4.2 Board overlay
- Required cells: faint gold highlight until painted
- Legend: "금색 — 반드시 지나가야 하는 칸" (R4, R5)

### P4.3 Loophole prevention
- [ ] BFS / `slide` semantics 일치 (ice 활성 라운드는 ice 포함)
- [ ] Goal remains stoppable
- [ ] Player can always Reset (no soft-lock)
- [ ] Unit tests in `__tests__/gameLogic.test.ts`

### P4.4 Deferred: one-way gates
- Option A (gates) — backlog; path forcing (Option B)를 R4/R5에 우선 적용

